{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1444687-aberrant-tech-crafting","id":1444687,"title":"[Aberrant] Tech Crafting","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-19T11:30:55-07:00","id":1444687,"title":"[Aberrant] Tech Crafting","content":"I'm reading the crafting rules, and looking at the tech tables on 235 and 237 of the pdf which show, respectively, the abilities of different tech Ranks and their suggested Complexity Scales.<br /> <br /> It is suggested for Mega Crafting that a Mega Attribute can give Scale:<br /> <br /> &quot;Whenever the nova forms a dice pool related to the<br /> crafting project, she may apply her Mega-Attributes as various types of Scale to overcome the Difficulty or Complications, usually adding 2 Enhancement per dot of Mega-Attribute&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Here's my question, that I don't think the books answer: <br /> <br /> I'm a Mega-Int 1 Nova, so therefore Scale 2 for intellect. I attempt to invent and craft a Rank 5 item, which is complexity Scale 3. Is my difficulty 5, as stated in the base crafting rules, +2 for being lower Scale?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26631-btriplem","name":"BtripleM","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T11:37:48-07:00","id":1444691,"title":"","content":"I read it as a Rank 5 item is Difficulty 5 with a Complexity Scale of 3. So, if you Mega-Int 1, you are Scale 2, which puts you 1 Scale below the Complexity Scale. That would mean you're facing a Difficulty of 7 (5 + 2 for being 1 Scale lower.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T11:52:47-07:00","id":1444695,"title":"","content":"That makes sense, and is what I think the rules suggest, but the linear difficulty causes some problems.<br /> <br /> Let's say I have Int 5, Tech 5 and Mega Int 5. I am now Scale 6 and, in theory, can craft a Rank 8 item unimpeded.<br /> <br /> I require 8 successes at TN 7. That's something I will achieve 0.16 % of the time. Doing that 8 times in a row, as the rules demand, has odds of (roughly) 1 in 2 500,000.<br /> <br /> The linear scaling of difficulty with crafting doesn't feel right.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26631-btriplem","name":"BtripleM","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T12:09:17-07:00","id":1444696,"title":"","content":"Look into the Inventor Mega-Edge. It lets you add your Mega-Int scale + another Mega-Attribute's scale. If you had Mega-Cunning 5 and Mega-Intellect 5 you'd be throwing around 11 scale. That Rank 8 device would then be Difficulty 8 with 10 enhancements.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T12:44:28-07:00","id":1444701,"title":"","content":"Huh... and you can do that on every roll too. Can't believe i missed that. Thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26631-btriplem","name":"BtripleM","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}